AB  - The need for effective and engaging communication tools has increased in this age of remote work and virtual teamwork. In this time, having an interactive meeting environment without facing the virtual platform constraints has proved to be beneficial and engaging in today's era. Taking this into consideration, this research project is carried out for the development of a virtual meeting platform where people can come together in virtual environments and conduct meetings. Also, integration of artificial intelligence (AI) technologies into virtual meeting applications has enhanced communication experiences. The goal of this project is to develop an interactive virtual meeting platform with features like dynamic personalization which include creation of personalized and customizable avatar which represents the person in the virtual world, interlanguage translation to avoid the language barrier in the meeting and help in smooth communication, spatial audio effects, AI-powered automated meeting summary feature which gives a detailed summary of the key points discussed at the end of the meeting, and subtitle production. Advanced methods for audio processing include spatial audio, allowing users to follow speech direction and volume by utilizing avatar placements. By modifying avatar look, audio settings, and content recommendations based on unique preferences and actions, AI systems personalize the user experience. The study tells how these developments affect participation, productivity, and accessibility in virtual meetings and provides predictions about the direction AI-driven communication tools may take in the future.
